{
  "id": "vllm-0.31.0-h100",
  "engine": "vLLM v0.31.0",
  "hardware": "h100-sxm",
  "sources": {
    "trace": "data/traces/vllm-0.31.0_qwen3-8b-3layers_rtx3070: vLLM v0.31.0 kernel sequence for Qwen3-8B in BF16, with the ops of each Inductor kernel read from the generated Triton code (RTX 3070; FA2 instead of FA3)",
    "qwen3": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/model_executor/models/qwen3.py: one QKV GEMM, one O GEMM, one gate+up GEMM, one down GEMM; the residual add is passed into the next RMSNorm",
    "inductor": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/config/vllm.py (custom_ops = none under Inductor) and vllm/platforms/cuda.py (get_default_ir_op_priority: native when compiling): RMSNorm, residual add, QK-norm, RoPE, SiLU·mul and the per-token FP8 quant are PyTorch code that Inductor fuses into Triton kernels",
    "fa3_backend": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/v1/attention/backends/flash_attn.py: FA3 with aot_schedule, so get_scheduler_metadata runs once per step; max_num_splits is the CUDA-graph cap (32) when the step fits a full graph, else 0 (FA3 heuristic); reshape_and_cache_flash writes the KV cache before the attention call",
    "fa3_kernels": "vllm-project/flash-attention 9cd61de: hopper/flash_prepare_scheduler.cu (prepare_varlen_num_blocks_kernel), hopper/flash_fwd_launch_template.h (FlashAttnFwdSm90), hopper/flash_api.cpp (FlashAttnFwdCombine runs when params.num_splits > 1)",
    "fp8_block": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/model_executor/kernels/linear/scaled_mm/flashinfer.py: FlashInferFp8DeepGEMMDynamicBlockScaledKernel calls the custom op dynamic_flashinfer_deepgemm_blockscale_gemm, which quantizes the activation inside the op and picks FlashInfer swapAB (M < 32) or DeepGEMM (M >= 32) with torch.cond; Inductor cannot fuse the quant into the RMSNorm",
    "flashinfer": "FlashInfer 0.7.0.post1 csrc/nv_internal/tensorrt_llm/kernels/cutlass_kernels/fp8_blockscale_gemm/fp8_blockscale_gemm_kernel.cuh (fp8_gemm_run launches scale_1x128_kernel, then the GEMM) and csrc/nv_internal/tensorrt_llm/deep_gemm/compiler.cuh (fp8_gemm_kernel_swapAB)",
    "deepgemm": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/utils/fp8_utils.py (per_token_group_quant_fp8 calls the CUDA op in csrc/libtorch_stable/quantization/w8a8/fp8/per_token_group_quant.cu, per_token_group_quant_8bit_kernel) and vllm-project/DeepGEMM e1f418c csrc/jit_kernels/impls/sm90_fp8_gemm_1d2d.hpp (sm90_fp8_gemm_1d2d_impl)",
    "fp8_tensor": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/online/fp8.py (Fp8PerTensorOnlineLinearMethod, per-token dynamic activation scales with CUTLASS) and vllm/model_executor/kernels/linear/scaled_mm/ScaledMMLinearKernel.py (QuantFP8, native under Inductor, then cutlass_scaled_mm); the fusion of the quant into the preceding RMSNorm or SiLU·mul is inferred from Inductor's reduction fusion, not traced",
    "marlin": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/model_executor/kernels/linear/scaled_mm/marlin.py (MarlinFP8ScaledMMLinearKernel: BF16 activations, no input quant) and csrc/libtorch_stable/quantization/marlin/kernel.h (Marlin); vLLM uses it on H100 only when forced",
    "lm_head": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/fp8.py: get_quant_method quantizes LinearBase layers only, so ParallelLMHead stays BF16",
    "model_runner": "vLLM v0.31.0 vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_runner.py: sample_hidden_states = hidden_states[input_batch.logits_indices] before compute_logits"
  },
